{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"786a2394fd0b033743052cc19bd4626d3511f1df19b12c3240c846b76c441711","ja":"「サバイバル生活、5日目」","zh":"「荒岛求生生活，第5天」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6ccdade2e564470e7d4f7a916d04578d6a070705f349196d7d18767934b676a7","ja":"ふぅ～……。\n子豚ちゃん達は元気にしているでしょうか～。","zh":"呼～……。\n小猪仔们不知道过得还好吗～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"919db9086f292e2cafad65deeed13957889f4c5ebf66e63b27d21b1a8259fa26","ja":"こうしている間にも、聖母へのメッセージが\n届いているかと思うと、胸が痛みます～。","zh":"一想到就在这期间，送给圣母的留言\n可能也正陆续送达，我的心就隐隐作痛呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0e7c5b2123f536bc880b9175d9e5df5022896f319b9d9d82e2ceabe567a2f7af","ja":"姫も、外に出て妖精さん達に会いたいのです。\n殺風景な宇宙船はちょっと飽きてしまったのですよ。","zh":"公主也想走到外面，去见见小妖精们。\n这么煞风景的宇宙飞船，人家都有点腻了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9c492905adaf5fe27a07ec25c24d1f76f8aaa8b1803eed35f3091dbc064b3cae","ja":"それに今日は、大好きな漫画の発売日なのです……。","zh":"而且今天还是喜欢的漫画的发售日呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"985d66c9b6b92ae0ecfe49aba56acd0f765a9e199c4ab14c67b9dc9f5d620289","ja":"昼食を持ってきました。\n……あの、大丈夫ですか？","zh":"我把午饭送过来了。\n……那个，您还好吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"eb70d0b6931fb1718924b1ba08aaf27885add8c0967a21103bef9d46e36a0b78","ja":"ありがとうございます～。大丈夫ですよ～。\nあと少し、頑張りましょう～。","zh":"谢谢您～。没关系的哦～。\n还差一点，一起加油吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"93124296b91bbecdf0a8091eb4fe3d784bed2b785b0e3eda24807280a8d01d5e","ja":"それにしても……千早さんは、\n今日までずっと、いつもと変わらない感じですね～？","zh":"话虽如此……千早一直到今天，\n都和平常没什么两样的感觉呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f7029e07f5d959a19657f24c32c9c944173309639879352b503dcded5b3ae8fb","ja":"ずっと狭い宇宙船の中にいて、嫌にならないのです？","zh":"一直待在狭小的宇宙飞船里，不会觉得讨厌吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"014241ef7289d269253ab44d2e23c35788aa9535fc92dcbe9eb6b09fa2c15e3f","ja":"特には……。部屋の防音がしっかりしているので、\n気兼ねなく、毎日自主レッスンできていますし。","zh":"倒也没有特别的事……房间的隔音效果很好，\n每天都能毫无顾虑地自主练习。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1f44f8ddb94c13ca1372795359a1a562e7de8b7b7e6e706ecfb0f0d6ad86e26e","ja":"いつもとそれほど変わりなく過ごせているので、\n嫌になることは……。あの、どうかしましたか？","zh":"过得和平时其实没什么两样，\n所以并不会觉得讨厌……那个，怎么了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"1531cc8ac83c1d227da450aa33142bfd09acdce1789a3b201c193bb050962b68","ja":"いえ……千早さんのすごさを、\n改めて感じていました～。","zh":"没……我只是再次感受到了\n千早小姐的厉害之处～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1231.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c86452823a57ea5ab1c45e334d81c22a48e9d0ca4091e1adba7bea591c08dbab","ja":"確かに、ここでもやれることがあるのです！\n姫も自主レッスンするのですよ！","zh":"确实，在这里也有能做的事情呢！\n公主也要自主练习哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
